-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Modifications made in this fork (2026)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Added the "blinder" bidirectional tokenization gateway on top of upstream:

  * masking of secrets / PII / credentials in data read through MCP tools
    (package net.portswigger.mcp.blinder.*)
  * an in-process vault holding the real values
  * rehydration that re-injects real values before requests leave Burp
  * dynamic-token (e.g. CSRF) live capture and injection via an HTTP handler
  * a human-gated reveal_placeholder tool (fail-closed, audit-logged)
  * a single deny-by-default MCP tool decorator (tools/GatewayTool.kt)
  * masking-mode configuration (OFF / SELECTIVE / STRICT)

